{"unit_id":"yingzaicc__dsh-editor-selection#card-zh","repo":"yingzaicc/dsh-editor-selection","commit":"220963b33784f7ff6b1ae78360bdbf8800941c12","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-editor-selection 是面向 DSH web 客户端的编辑器焦点上下文插件。它通过配对 WebSocket 接收编辑器当前文件路径、行范围和未保存状态，并在 agent 每步开始前以插件归因的环境消息提供焦点。网页侧栏提供设备配对审批与撤销，输入框旁显示焦点提示并可暂停共享；用户也可从编辑器请求 DSH 解释所选代码。适合希望让 DSH 对话跟随当前代码位置的开发者；需要 DSH web 宿主和已配对的编辑器桥接端，不要求外部 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:36-75","src/injector.ts:51-77","src/explain.ts:47-75","src/client/index.ts:38-60"]}
{"unit_id":"yingzaicc__dsh-editor-selection#card-en","repo":"yingzaicc/dsh-editor-selection","commit":"220963b33784f7ff6b1ae78360bdbf8800941c12","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-editor-selection gives DSH web agents the editor’s current file and selected lines as context. A paired editor supports device approval, a focus chip with a sharing toggle, and requests to explain selected code in the latest active session. It requires a DSH web host and paired editor bridge.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:36-75","src/injector.ts:51-77","src/explain.ts:47-75","src/client/index.ts:38-60"]}
